# 2.5 Carat Radiant Cut Diamond Ring: Lab Wins at 5×.

A 2.5 carat radiant cut diamond ring sits at an unusual place in the market. Most buyers land at 2ct or 3ct — round numbers, predictable pricing, deep inventory. At 2.5ct, you are stepping into a weight where the natural price acceleration becomes severe and the lab value case becomes almost impossible to ignore.

At 8.7×6.3mm face-up, a 2.5ct radiant cut is visibly larger than a 2ct. It is unmistakably present from across the room.

Every price on this page is stone plus setting. Every table has a "What this means" column. No fluff.

**TL;DR:**
- → **For lab buyers: exceptional.** 2.5ct D-VVS1 GIA lab ring from $5,605. That is a $30,000 stone for $4,745 on the open market.
- → **For natural buyers: the math is brutal.** 2.5ct natural ring starts at $30,396. The jump from 2ct natural ($18,574) to 2.5ct natural ($30,396) is 64% for 7% more face-up area.
- 2.5 carat radiant cut diamond rings from [$5,605 lab](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?ShapeID=Radiant&ct=2.4-2.6&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) or [$30,396 natural](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/22603770?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- → Best lab pick: [2.5ct D-VVS1 GIA $4,745](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28041707?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Ten Prong WG $860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$5,605**
- → Natural sweet spot: [2.5ct E-VS1 GIA $32,081](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28823897?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Ten Prong WG $860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$32,941**
- Contrarian truth: G-VS2 at $30,396 complete is the natural entry, but E-VS1 at $32,941 is the real sweet spot — the $2,545 premium buys a stone that reads colorless in every metal and every light condition.
- → See the [2.5ct Premium Wall](#the-25ct-premium-wall) and the [Skip-Weight Advantage](#the-skip-weight-advantage) below.

