> **Farzana's Verdict on Lab 2.5ct:**
>
> The D-VVS1 GIA at [$5,605](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28041707?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) complete is the clear choice. At 2.5ct, you are already into 8.7mm face-up territory — the stone will command the hand. Spending an additional $6,938 to reach D-IF GIA status means you have paid twice the money for a certificate improvement no eye can detect.
